('ungm-notices','UN Global Marketplace – notices/RFQs (IQ, JO, LB, LY, YE, SD, SY)','السوق العالمية للأمم المتحدة – طلبات العروض','rfq','intl','en','html','https://www.ungm.org/Public/Notice','GET',NULL,'{}','C',0,1,'Public page 200; listing comes from POST /Public/Notice/Search (internal JSON) -> my guessed body got HTTP 400. robots.txt present (561 B). Worth finishing: real RFQs from UN agencies in Arab countries.',2,'https://www.ungm.org/Public/Notice',1,'no open machine-readable access (unverified) — official link only','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('eu_ft_portal_sedia','EU Funding & Tenders Portal - Search API (SEDIA)',NULL,'tender_gov','EU institutions & agencies tenders (eTendering, incl. EU Delegations worldwide) + EU grant calls (Horizon Europe, LIFE, Digital Europe, Single Market...)','en','html','https://api.tech.ec.europa.eu/search-api/prod/rest/search?apiKey=SEDIA&text=***&pageSize=50&pageNumber=1','GET',NULL,'{}','C',0,1,'',2,'https://api.tech.ec.europa.eu/search-api/prod/rest/search?apiKey=SEDIA&text=***&pageSize=50&pageNumber=1',1,'apiKey "SEDIA" not documented by the Commission for third-party use — disabled; TED covers EU tenders','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('uk_find_a_tender_ocds','UK Find a Tender Service — OCDS release packages','المملكة المتحدة — خدمة Find a Tender (مناقصات عامة)','tender_gov','eu','en','json','https://www.find-tender.service.gov.uk/api/1.0/ocdsReleasePackages?limit=100&updatedFrom={{date-1}}T00:00:00Z','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"json","accept":"application/json","pages":1,"kind_map":{"field":"buyer_type","map":{"semi":"tender_semi","private":"tender_private"},"default":"tender_gov"}}','A',1,1,'Official API, Open Government Licence v3.0; robots.txt: 404. No stages filter: stages=tender returns only the few legacy (PCR 2015) notices — Procurement Act 2023 tender notices are kept by their ''tender''/''tenderUpdate'' tag. Newest first, 100 per call, every 2 h. Contact points are never read.',2,'https://www.find-tender.service.gov.uk/Search',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('uk_contracts_finder_ocds','UK Contracts Finder — OCDS search','المملكة المتحدة — Contracts Finder (عقود حكومية أصغر)','tender_gov','eu','en','json','https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Published/Notices/OCDS/Search?publishedFrom={{date-2}}&publishedTo={{date}}&stages=tender&limit=100','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"json","accept":"application/json","pages":1,"kind_map":{"field":"buyer_type","map":{"semi":"tender_semi","private":"tender_private"},"default":"tender_gov"}}','C',1,1,'Official API, Open Government Licence v3.0; robots.txt: 404. ''limit'' (not ''size''). Link = the notice page published in tender.documents. Contact points are never read.',2,'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Search',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
