('fr_boamp_api','France BOAMP (DILA) - Opendatasoft Explore API v2.1','فرنسا — النشرة الرسمية لإعلانات المشتريات العامة (BOAMP)','tender_gov','eu','fr','json','https://boamp-datadila.opendatasoft.com/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/boamp/records?limit=100&order_by=dateparution%20desc','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"json","accept":"application/json","pages":1}','C',0,1,'Licence Ouverte / Etalab 2.0, but robots.txt (identical on www.boamp.fr and boamp-datadila.opendatasoft.com): User-agent: * → Disallow: /api/ (RSS/Atom exports also disallowed). The research note that /api/ is allowed was wrong. Adapter is ready if DILA grants access or the rule changes.',2,'https://www.boamp.fr/',1,'robots.txt of boamp-datadila.opendatasoft.com disallows /api/ for all crawlers except Googlebot (re-checked 2026-11-18) — official link only','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
