('aiib_project_procurement','AIIB – project procurement notices','البنك الآسيوي للاستثمار في البنية التحتية – إعلانات مشتريات المشروعات','tender_gov','intl','en','adapter','https://www.aiib.org/en/opportunities/business/project-procurement/_common/ppo-data-all.js','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"bigtables","market_from":"market_key","kind_map":{"field":"kind_hint","map":{"semi":"tender_semi","rfq":"rfq","project":"project","award":"project_news"}}}','C',1,1,'Static data file loaded by the public list page; robots.txt disallows only *.jsp/*.php/*.aspx and /cm*/ /sy*/ (re-checked 2026-11-18). Unofficial format: a change raises an explicit parse error instead of guessing. Daily, conditional GET (ETag). Contract awards are not stored (the contractor field names individual consultants).',3,'https://www.aiib.org/en/opportunities/business/project-procurement/list.html',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
