('isdb-egypt-rss','Islamic Development Bank – project procurement RSS (Egypt term)',NULL,'tender_gov','eg','en','rss','https://www.isdb.org/project-procurement/taxonomy/term/10/feed','GET',NULL,'{}','A',1,1,'robots.txt allows /project-procurement/ (only admin/user/search paths disallowed).',1,'https://www.isdb.org/',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('sczone-tenders','SCZONE — tenders, auctions & practices','الهيئة العامة للمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس — المناقصات والمزايدات والممارسات','tender_semi','eg','ar','adapter','https://sczone.eg/tenders/','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"egypt","accept":"text/html,application/xhtml+xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8","pages":1,"title_dedupe":false,"kind_map":{"field":"kind_hint","map":{"tender":"tender_semi","auction":"tender_semi","award":"project_news","project":"project","news":"news"},"default":"tender_semi"}}','C',1,1,'robots.txt is one line without line breaks («User-agent: *Disallow: /wp-admin/Allow: /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php…»): only /wp-admin/ is meant to be disallowed and the engine''s parser reads no rule — /tenders/ is allowed either way (checked 2026-11-18). WP REST API needs auth (401) and /feed/ errors, so the HTML page is parsed. Notices have no page of their own: the official link is each notice''s conditions booklet (PDF/DOCX in /uplibrary/). Booklet price and bid bond go into the excerpt; the authority''s phone numbers are not stored. Re-tenders of the same subject carry near-identical titles (fire engines 0.90, cleaning 0.87, scales 0.80 trigram similarity), so same-source title dedupe stays off (title_dedupe: false).',2,'https://sczone.eg/tenders/',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('hcww-tenders','Holding Company for Water & Wastewater (HCWW) — tender news','الشركة القابضة لمياه الشرب والصرف الصحي — أخبار المناقصات','tender_semi','eg','ar','json','https://www.hcww.com.eg/wp-json/wp/v2/posts?categories=20&per_page=20&_fields=id,date,date_gmt,link,title','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"json","accept":"application/json","pages":1,"ai_title_only":true,"title_dedupe":false}','C',1,1,'robots.txt allows /wp-json/ (disallows only /wp-content/plugins/, /readme.html, /refer/). Title + date + link only: the ad itself is a scanned image (not OCR''d). Titles repeat per water company, so title-similarity dedupe should be off for this source (title_dedupe: false).',2,'https://www.hcww.com.eg/أخبار-المناقصات',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('ida-news','Industrial Development Authority (IDA) — tenders, industrial land & unit offerings, news','الهيئة العامة للتنمية الصناعية — المناقصات وطرح الأراضي والوحدات الصناعية والأخبار','tender_gov','eg','ar','adapter','https://www.ida.gov.eg/ar/news?page={{page}}','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"egypt","accept":"text/html,application/xhtml+xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8","pages":2,"max_age_days":45,"title_dedupe":false,"kind_map":{"field":"kind_hint","map":{"tender":"tender_gov","auction":"tender_gov","project":"project","award":"project_news","news":"news"},"default":"news"}}','C',1,1,'robots.txt: User-agent: * / Disallow: /admin/ (news pages allowed; checked 2026-11-18). 9 cards per page (?page=N). Titles over ~150 characters are cut by the site (kept with «…»). Tender cards carry no closing date; the notice page adds the subject and the booklet link. IDA''s numbered tenders differ only by their number («المناقصة العامة رقم (10)» / «(11)», trigram similarity 0.91), so same-source title dedupe must stay off (title_dedupe: false).',2,'https://www.ida.gov.eg/ar/news',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('eeaa-notifications','Egyptian Environmental Affairs Agency (EEAA) — notifications: EOIs, bids, RFQs','جهاز شئون البيئة — التنويهات (طلبات إبداء الاهتمام والمناقصات وطلبات الأسعار)','tender_gov','eg','ar','adapter','https://www.eeaa.gov.eg/Notification/Index','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"egypt","accept":"text/html,application/xhtml+xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8","pages":1,"max_age_days":60,"kind_map":{"field":"kind_hint","map":{"tender":"tender_gov","eoi":"tender_gov","rfq":"rfq","auction":"tender_gov","project":"project","award":"project_news","news":"news"},"default":"tender_gov"}}','C',1,1,'robots.txt answers 302 → /Home/error, an HTML page with no rules (re-checked 2026-11-18 several times; the research step had seen HTTP 500): the engine reads no rule, i.e. allowed. Public government notices, one table without paging; job, training and staff notices are skipped. The closing date is only on each notice''s page («تاريخ النهاية», equal to the World Bank deadline of the same notice). Most notices are World Bank–financed and also reach wb-eg in English.',2,'https://www.eeaa.gov.eg/Notification/Index',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
('wb-projects-eg','World Bank Projects API v3 — Egypt pipeline & active projects','البنك الدولي — مشروعات مصر المرتقبة والجارية','project','eg','en','json','https://search.worldbank.org/api/v3/projects?format=json&rows=50&os=0&countrycode_exact=EG&status_exact=Pipeline%5EActive&srt=boardapprovaldate&order=desc&fl=id,project_name,boardapprovaldate,countryshortname,countrycode,regionname,status,totalamt,borrower,impagency,project_abstract','GET',NULL,'{"adapter":"json","accept":"application/json","pages":1,"market_from":"market_hint","max_age_days":1900}','C',1,1,'World Bank Search API v3, public, no key; Terms of Use for Datasets (CC BY 4.0). robots.txt: 404 (no rules). The v2 projects index is stale (still lists dropped projects as Pipeline) — v3 is used.',2,'https://projects.worldbank.org/en/projects-operations/projects-list?countrycode_exact=EG',1,NULL,'2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z','2026-11-18T18:20:47.742Z'),
